app ZyraEnterprise {
  runtime web
  language typescript
  strict true
  verbatim true

  build verbatim """
Create the Zyra Enterprise vibe-coding runtime.

Include:
- .zyra source files
- TypeScript-compatible generated output
- deterministic requirement manifests
- exact preservation of user-specified names
- exact preservation of routes and visible copy
- validation before success is reported

Do not rename requested features.
Do not silently remove requested functionality.
Do not replace working requirements with placeholders.
"""
}
